id: pm-o3fh
title: Move meet/event/remind calendar shortcuts from core surface into the builtin-calendar package as create sugar
description: "The three calendar shortcut commands become builtin-calendar package-owned commands (or pm create --template sugar), removing 3 top-level core entries while keeping every flag; core keeps alias shims while the deprecation cycle runs. Duplicate check: PR#263 shipped the shortcuts; pm-ixoa is a calendar service collision, different concern."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[5]: agent-ux,"area:cli","area:extensions",calendar,simplification
created_at: "2026-07-05T04:53:33.905Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-18T03:55:51.731Z"
